{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id36072845"}, "name":{"label":"dwk777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-26T10:07:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"13557836324"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, but major travel flaw"}, "content":{"label":"I really like this app. It’s simple, accurate, and motivating. Unfortunately, an international flight wiped out my 90 day streak.\n\nAfter landing, the app re synced and reassigned my steps due to a time zone change, which broke my streak even though I did not miss my goal. There was no warning and no way to fix it.\n\nThis is a developer issue, not a user issue. If an app promotes streaks, it needs to handle travel properly. Losing a long streak this way is extremely discouraging.\n\nI hope the developers address this, because it shouldn’t happen", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
