{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id556981611"}, "name":{"label":"lokahyna"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-12T10:39:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"13505759742"}, "title":{"label":"Lost Data"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a user since 2016. I had a 100* day step streak from January 1st. With one of the recent updates, all of those steps were done, so there goes my streak. Very unfortunate. I will be looking for another step counter app. I don’t know how to contact customer support to help with this problem.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1151489612"}, "name":{"label":"ivetoftaa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-11T16:52:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"13502977425"}, "title":{"label":"Does not sync well with apple watch"}, "content":{"label":"If I don't open and refresh the app before midnight, a good chunk of my steps will go missing. It shows I hit my goal on my watch, but when I check my phone the next morning, my streak has ended. Sometimes it's fixed by importing health data in the settings, but sometimes the app says there is no new data. Keeping my streak really motivates me to keep walking, but if it gets ended over and over again over technical issues, I'm going to have to look for a better app. 👎", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
