{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id538326286"}, "name":{"label":"Typical Ami"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-02T18:49:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"13468699064"}, "title":{"label":"Loved this App - Need Enhancements to Support Garmin Devices"}, "content":{"label":"I loved this app. It gives me immense satisfaction to see my streak growing day by day. Everyday when it turns green after completing target it gives great pleasure. However, I recently purchased a Garmin health tracker since I find it inconvenient to carry my phone. The problem is this app only considers the steps measured by phone and not all data present in iPhones inbuilt health app. It also does not consider manually added steps. Because of these reasons I will end up removing this app in couple of days. If developers consider making these changes. I would certainly download again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
