{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id85938065"}, "name":{"label":"Mark N Florida"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-23T01:47:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"13431053836"}, "title":{"label":"Not for international travelers"}, "content":{"label":"I have used this app for at least four years. It pains me not to give a five star rating because normally it is excellent. It keeps track of how many days in a row you reach your goal, but for anyone that travels internationally that is where the problem is. When you change countries and change time zones, your entire history gets shifted to the new time zone! I have over 1,000 days in a row of exceeding my goals. Recently I went to Japan from my home in Europe. And when I changed to the Japanese time zone, it dropped to less than 100! it changed my entire history to the Japanese time zone, which made absolutely no sense at all. Apple fitness freezes the past instead of dynamically updating it, which makes perfect sense. Why this app does not do the same mystifies me. If you don’t travel internationally, it’s a great app. If you do travel internationally, don’t waste your time on it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
